;"ENCOUNTER"系イベント（エクストラ構文）
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
@M_KOJO_ENCOUNTER_K61
;初対面、挨拶のタイミング
;TALENTの変更はここでどうぞ。
;経験の変更は齟齬が出る場合がありますので、CSVを修正し同梱する事を推奨します
IF GET_MAPID(CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置) == MAIN_MAP && MAIN_MAP == 4
	PRINTFORML 「...I heard a certain weirdo named %CALLNAME:MASTER% decided to choose this place for %HIS_HER(MASTER)% dwelling, was that you?」
	PRINTFORMW 「By the way, name's Mokou, Fujiwara no Mokou. I too am a weirdo who's been living here from the time immemorial.」
	PRINTFORML 「Since you went out of your way to settle here of all places, I assume you have some kind of Ability, yes?」
	PRINTFORML 「Lemme give you a fair warning - don't venture too far into the bamboo forest.」
	PRINTFORMW 「It's quite a dangerous place after all.」
	PRINTFORML 「...Hey, calling me "cute" is not a line you should use on a person you've just seen for the first time, you know.」
	PRINTFORML 「That said, it doesn't look like we'll get too involved in my opinion...」
	PRINTFORMW 「But I'll be here to keep you company, if you ever feel like it.」
;竹林以外のメインマップで出会った
ELSEIF GET_MAPID(CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置) == MAIN_MAP && (MAIN_MAP != 4 && MAIN_MAP != 2)
	PRINTFORML 「...You hail from %GET_MAPNAME(MAIN_MAP)%, correct?」
	PRINTFORML 「Oh yes, my name is Fujiwara no Mokou, a human who lives in the Bamboo Forest of the Lost.」
	PRINTFORML 「I came here sensing some kind of odd commotion, but it must've been just you then. %CALLNAME:MASTER%, is it?」
	PRINTFORMW 「...Hang on, calling me cute out of the blue like that makes this awfully awkward, you know.」
	PRINTFORML 「It's not like being told that by a complete stranger is going to make me happy or anything.」
	PRINTFORML 「So you want to get along with me? Haha, please, if you're going to live there, you'll find lots of people much better than me.」
	PRINTFORML 「Anyways, I visited today just because I felt like it, but normally I don't really bother coming here at all.」
	PRINTFORMW 「So if you're really set on speaking with me, you'll have better luck finding me in the forest or the village.」
;メインマップが竹林以外かつ、竹林で出会った
ELSEIF GET_MAPID(CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置) == 4
	PRINTFORML 「This forest is not a place for a regular person to wander in.」
	PRINTFORML 「Come now, I'll escort you to the village... Wait a minute, you seem to have some sort of weird magic placed on you.」
	IF MAIN_MAP == 0
		PRINTFORML 「You live in a Hakurei Shrine? Did that Shrine Maiden take you in?」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「Is that your way of protecting yourself?」
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORMW 「Oh well, in that case you should be fine then, but it doesn't change the fact that it's dangerous around here.」
	PRINTFORML 「Don't blame me if some nameless uncivilized youkai claims you as their snack, okay?」
	PRINTFORML 「Hm? Oh, I'm Fujiwara no Mokou, I live in this forest.」
	PRINTFORML 「...Look, when someone I meet for the first time suddenly tells me that I'm "cute", it just honestly makes me feel uneasy.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Listen, it really is dangerous around here, so you should hurry back home.」
	PRINTFORML 「...You should know by now that I've got nothing interesting to say, or anything.」
	PRINTFORMW 「But still, if you REALLY wish to speak with me, I'm not stopping you.」
;竹林以外で出会った
ELSEIF GET_MAPID(CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置) != 4
	PRINTFORML 「...Umm, what's up? Can I help you?」
	PRINTFORML 「There's lots of people who seem confused after meeting me, but I'm yet to see someone who would stare at me like that.」
	PRINTFORML 「So I can't help but feel a little curious is all.」
	PRINTFORML 「You think I'm cute? ...If that's your way of hitting on me, then I'll have to turn you down, sorry.」
	SELECTCASE MAIN_MAP
		CASE 0,2,3
			PRINTFORML 「So you're one of the lodgers from %GET_MAPNAME(MAIN_MAP)%? A freeloader then?」
			PRINTFORML 「Hmmm, looks like that place has its fair share of weirdos as well.」
		CASEELSE
			PRINTFORML 「So you're one of the %GET_MAPNAME(MAIN_MAP)% residents, eh?」
			PRINTFORML 「That's quite laudable of you to make it here way from over there.」
	ENDSELECT
	PRINTFORML 「Oh, I'm yet to introduce myself. My name is Fujiwara no Mokou.」
	PRINTFORML 「I usually stay at the Bamboo Forest, but occasionally I end up coming here to take care of my errands.」
	PRINTFORML 「...Well, I'd be willing to hear you out once in a while if you so desire.」
	PRINTFORMW 「To think there's someone who'd be eager to spend their time with me for some reason... Turns out such weirdos do exist after all.」
ENDIF
PRINTL 
RETURN 1

