;==================================================
;デート帰りに告白（恋人が付く）
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_SPEVENT_K61_2(ARG,ARG:1)
;口上主はTARGET
;地の文表示
;--------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;小分岐
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;告白内容
	;この告白内容表示後に受けるかどうかの選択分が表示されます
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 0
		PRINTFORMW 「I've been by myself as long as I remember.」
		PRINTFORML 「I haven't gotten a single letter since the day my Father didn't make it back to Mother, even the day when my Mother passed away.」
		PRINTFORML 「...It was then that I learned that a certain wench who appeared not much older than me... was behind all of this.」
		PRINTFORML 「I had really become alone in this world.」
		PRINTFORML 「I committed lots of atrocities in order to obtain the Hourai Elixir, and after that...」
		PRINTFORML 「I've spent my time in isolation, away from the hateful eyes of people.」
		PRINTFORML 「Though after I met Kaguya and the days we've spent killing each other made me feel truly alive once again...」
		PRINTFORMW 「Still, the dread of growing too intimate with other people was too strong.」
		PRINTFORML 「...But then, then... I felt happy, now that I managed to become close with you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%.」
		PRINTFORML 「I feel truly happy when I'm able to have fun together with you. When I can share laughs with you.」
		PRINTFORML 「I'm well aware of what awaits us... Spending my time with you until your final days... And watching you pass away...」
		PRINTFORML 「But even despite all that, I still wish to share my true love with you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%. I want to keep you all to myself. I want to make you mine.」
		PRINTFORMW 「...So, I ask you... Would you be so kind as... to take me... as your lover?」
		PRINTFORML 
		PRINTFORML
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;告白オッケー（恋人が付く）
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 1
		PRINTFORML 「...Really, are you sure? ...Thank you, I appreciate it.」
		PRINTFORML 「Huh, there's something you want to share with me too?」
		CALL K61_CONFESSION_NAMESET
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;告白失敗
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 2
		PRINTFORML 「Yeah, I thought so. When it comes to me, you have lots of other nicer people in your reach after all.」
		PRINTFORML 「It's fine, you don't have to be so considerate of me.」
		PRINTFORMW 「A person's heart can't be forced by anyone, even by the person himself.」
		PRINTFORML 「I know it better than anyone else to be honest.」
		PRINTFORML 「...Fufu, it's just the way it is, really. ...And no, I'm not crying... *Sniff*」
		PRINTFORML 「Not at all... *Sniff*... *Sniff*... Uwaaa...!」
		PRINTFORMW 「Please... *Sniff*... Don't pity me... Uwaaa...」
		PRINTFORML 
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF

ENDIF
RETURN 1

