			PRINTFORML 「Thanks a bunch for today as well, %CALLNAME:MASTER%. It's been a lot of fun hanging out with you.」
			PRINTFORML 「But you know, it feels a little sad that it passed by in no time though.」
		ELSEIF 陥落状態() == 2
			PRINTFORML 「That was a lot of fun, fufu... There, let me express my gratitude... *Chuuu!*」
			SIF !TALENT:キス未経験 && !TALENT:MASTER:キス未経験
				CALL MUTUAL_KISS
		ELSEIF 陥落状態() == 1
			PRINTFORML 「Hmm, well I guess it's fine doing this once in a while.」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「...To go out of your way to ask me out...」
			PRINTFORML 「Well, did you have fun?」
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORMW
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;反発刻印消去イベント
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
