    PRINTFORMDL Mokou's home is simple, but it has everything you'd need to live comfortably.
    SELECTCASE YOGORE:(CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置)
		CASE IS < 500
            PRINTFORMDL It's surprisingly neat and tidy, and you can't find a speck of dirt anywhere.
